    <span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Rentals</span>
    <h1>Hanoi Motorbike Rental: Couples Parking Strategy</h1>
    <p>Parking is the most shared activity of a couple's riding day. The rider finds the spot and steadies the machine; the passenger dismounts first, gathers the layers, and holds the two-person opinions about whether the spot is a good one. Done well, parking is a quick, wordless dance that couples learn in a day and use for the whole trip. Done badly, it is the daily argument, on a curb, in heat, with a queue watching. This guide makes parking the dance.</p>
    <p>The page is part of the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> cluster, written for couples. Verified fleet prices are on the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">cost hub</a>, the general question bank is on the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a> page, and the machine that carries the two of you is chosen in the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/couples-bike-choice/">couples bike choice guide</a>.</p>

    <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
      <p>On this page</p>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="#sec-1">Parking as a two-person routine</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sec-2">Where motorbikes park in Hanoi</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sec-3">The dismount, the lock and the departure order</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sec-4">Two people's luggage, zoned</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sec-5">Researching the day's destinations</a></li>
